<title>UK: Midland Bank sets 300 mln stg July 2000 FRN.</title>
<headline>Midland Bank sets 300 mln stg July 2000 FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager HSBC.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MIDLAND BANK PLC</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN STG   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	JULY.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     FLAT	PAY DATE    29.JUL.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AA3	 ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   0.125</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A+	  REOFFER    PAR</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 1-10-100-1M</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  0.625</p>
<p>SALE LIMITS UK</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
